# Unravel Two - 1225570

After installation complete.
Click Online Patch, then do below steps, make sure steam is running.

**Activating Steam Remote Play**
1. Press Windows + R ; 
2. Copy ```steam://install/349620```
and then paste the text field and click OK ; 
3. Start installing BlastZone 2 Demo for a couple of seconds, stop and delete; 
4. Open Folder and then Launch the game from UnravelTwo.exe
